# Terraform
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the dependency
# lockfile for a root module and belongs in version control - it is what makes
# `terraform init` reproducible, and what stops the generated provider-version
# table in stacks/terraform/README.md from drifting on every provider release.
# Generate hashes for every platform your team and CI use:
#   terraform providers lock -platform=linux_amd64 -platform=darwin_arm64 -platform=windows_amd64

# Helm
charts/*.tgz

